BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Scratch Coding For Kids (9+) PART 2
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T163000
UID:69fb7927f89ee1580050ec21@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this class\, kids will learn the basic concepts of coding b
 y using Scratch's block based coding system while creating a simple video 
 game.\nThis class is open to children ages 9 and up. Computers will be pro
 vided.\nFor more information about this program please contact dihonline@t
 pl.ca.
LOCATION:Jane/Sheppard\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fb7927f89ee1580050ec21
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
